#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32G0 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32G0 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (G030, G031, G041, G050, G051, G061, G070, G071, G081, G0B1, G0C1)
